sequenceDiagram
    participant CeleryBeat as Celery Beat
    participant Task as Celery Task
    participant CoachingService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant LLM as LLM Gateway
    participant PushService
    participant FCM as Firebase Cloud Messaging
    actor User

    CeleryBeat->>+Task: Trigger run_daily_coaching()<br/>(at user's preferred hour)

    Task->>+CoachingService: run_daily_coaching()

    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
        Note over CoachingService,DB: Step 1: Find Eligible Users
        CoachingService->>+DB: SELECT users with<br/>coaching_reminders_enabled = true
        DB-->>-CoachingService: List of users
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 230)
        Note over CoachingService,FCM: Step 2: Generate & Send Coaching
        loop For each eligible user
            CoachingService->>+DB: Gather 24h activity snapshot<br/>(meals, workouts, water, sleep)
            DB-->>-CoachingService: Tracking logs

            CoachingService->>+LLM: Send snapshot, request coaching tip<br/>with urgency level
            LLM-->>-CoachingService: Coaching tip + urgency

            CoachingService->>+DB: INSERT CoachingMessage<br/>(category="daily", urgency level)
            DB-->>-CoachingService: Saved

            CoachingService->>+PushService: send_push(device_tokens, tip)
            PushService->>+FCM: Send push notification
            FCM-->>-PushService: Delivery status
            PushService-->>-CoachingService: Sent
        end
    end

    CoachingService-->>-Task: Complete
    Task-->>-CeleryBeat: Done

    FCM-->>User: Push notification with coaching tip

    Note over User: View messages via<br/>GET /coaching/messages
